  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "После того как магнитный друг открыл проход, Мика направил корабль в чёрное пространство.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "31412745e782ceaef52495617b8f85b7260d1f08857c9752b7f2f46316ab48e5"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Нам туда!",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 1120,
      "sha256": "0c21b30fa69ecd9c77bee166d8937fee7a44505806b97b270cabaf50243051f1"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Корабль Мики влетел в пространственный туннель.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 3040,
      "sha256": "4ff07b3650b647c8df676f33fe2bbb457e885cfbb82f66773eda973801bc719f"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "За туннелем их ждала огромная розовая планета.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "a21ef846d5cac2be507a779f0b74a00d84295d312ca2acc718fdbf9669b6c4df"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Мир нейронных существ сильно отличался от всего, что они видели раньше.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "0319d1ac1171c2c078b4513f4aeadfb3392b570e515efce606129a7088969670"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Старые знакомые встретились спустя много лет. Мика не понимал, о чём они говорили, но было ясно: они рады друг другу.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 8560,
      "sha256": "2f78c6e3eaa53dae49651bf6e9da4d2b81ad7acc0fc85764910a2551695556ee"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P01_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Мика воспользовался их симулятором, чтобы погрузиться в телепатический транс.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "36071b2434c913175d918d8c795a58ad54cb6b7337969a49a3e089aaa6120ac2"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "After our magnetic friend opened the passage, Mika steered the ship into the darkness of space.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "5d4b1190790a26ee46b85c70839e018dd16a24d17b6606084a225e8409984e99"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "That way!",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 1120,
      "sha256": "65c5d9c268c1470cad600385faae07fb07ede90f9df05aa5264c3d9e798a6093"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika’s ship shot into the tunnel through space.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "f884aa55f44b80e56a59f13894c2c1b6f2f6fedb69c9b9676c3beb5505694445"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Beyond the tunnel, an enormous pink planet awaited them.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "sha256": "ea6b86b3599fb3b5d6c296fe79bca47a7791fe681b1a6a96584159248b70e440"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "The world of the neural beings was unlike anything they had seen before.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "375274a0a910b4ad806b9e326702b5fd7b10d72220c63340bfa1a4d14e692a2a"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Old friends met again after many years. Mika couldn’t understand what they were saying, but it was clear they were happy to see each other.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "d01427f5dbe6177f6240b0166db031e63de5a9ccffe570359972c57d376b6904"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P01_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika used their simulator to enter a telepathic trance.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "0590da565fa06565a445f75494da35d13ec01fab6920a5553f0ceb323624d3b1"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Depois que o amigo magnético abriu a passagem, Mika conduziu a nave para a escuridão do espaço.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 6160,
      "sha256": "10e66e9936d8b7a4ab3d1b5f36f83d4e48e8fcd8a383a228aff3fc109c42c8a2"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "É por ali!",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 1040,
      "sha256": "f2be62a873888aa4dc5b44bfb992d602bfdb85a794a97bb881c087da53267b01"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "A nave de Mika disparou para dentro do túnel espacial.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "d09b0c7c6a882076159f5a097a7807ecfb0f16f5d9dc856ef9b4752c3f913277"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Do outro lado do túnel, um imenso planeta cor-de-rosa os esperava.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "9a6988f5508a7d474d66009ce9a43fbc1e255bd7a660eee987b02835ba105a44"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "O mundo dos seres neurais era diferente de tudo o que já tinham visto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "aab5bfd5f086518f7e258a5de541f7893974eacb5b6c14d706dc611b232bd76a"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Depois de tantos anos, velhos amigos se reencontraram. Mika não entendia o que diziam, mas dava para ver que estavam felizes em se rever.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 9440,
      "sha256": "1007f4f9803bf7474d3ebc6395f581ab38c8e0500d5d1c5aa1df8cf6d4b01742"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P01_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika usou o simulador deles para entrar em um transe telepático.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "sha256": "63e6c04b2b7fb6cd48163f6b4d81ed95e0f4bba5a87fb00d41066a36394990a9"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Cuando el amigo magnético abrió el paso, Mika dirigió la nave hacia la oscuridad del espacio.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5920,
      "sha256": "ef71a400219e02d3b480e803285387dd1ca5cb7e8fc93ed7cc05d62b45f449a1"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "¡Por ahí!",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 960,
      "sha256": "e2022750562379fea6dc9cd9646220306438a2a07649dbe600544d8e1136ac84"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "La nave de Mika se lanzó al túnel espacial.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 3040,
      "sha256": "d4e2f0e86cb22abc7c93876725b272cf79fac7844e5eca2ba7ce76ae94c9f638"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Al otro lado del túnel los esperaba un enorme planeta rosa.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "sha256": "71b58f948b5999763423e7e034c46efe46039a88ae2d903e208b4c561d8b2f95"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "El mundo de los seres neuronales era muy distinto de todo lo que habían visto antes.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "36e3b520b3d8b3bc9d6280b1140e62cae2aef7abc064d222a879e2f6f2492566"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Viejos amigos se reencontraron después de muchos años. Mika no entendía lo que decían, pero estaba claro que se alegraban de verse.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 8800,
      "sha256": "ac3205da51488b90ba78e1e6dbfc189a204e7352633b0d8c59938687697894c9"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P01_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika utilizó su simulador para sumergirse en un trance telepático.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "338a5a67196bea3981b8e3134ec747669707820360db2a012320a08890a2ff47"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Une fois le passage ouvert par leur ami magnétique, Mika dirigea son vaisseau vers les ténèbres de l’espace.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "sha256": "0afa2ad668221daea56db36af45154b17bc72cb26512fb1900b1cd7ac3b3e508"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "C’est par là !",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 1040,
      "sha256": "79e45a301aa0bd2aae3e96822229b4c6852203e98ddfdcb6ed0bc6c2ab046b95"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Le vaisseau de Mika s’engouffra dans le tunnel spatial.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "sha256": "80624cdce3df62374f0d83ad00ce265e729ce3da54d8c4169d041161f98d0134"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Au bout du tunnel, une immense planète rose les attendait.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "2c5699356fd18256255e5fe4f89aa59d87446da505aabd504da5cfe6f44f765b"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Le monde des êtres neuronaux ne ressemblait à rien de ce qu’ils avaient vu auparavant.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "15fc3eee19866102bceb7641b40609de4be28d7b260bc8bd45af63433b654aae"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "De vieux amis se retrouvaient après tant d’années. Mika ne comprenait pas ce qu’ils se disaient, mais leur joie de se revoir ne faisait aucun doute.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 8800,
      "sha256": "0c152e9562eeef6124c2650182d8403f801c724ba8253b65fdf256090a26ea86"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P01_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika utilisa leur simulateur pour entrer dans une transe télépathique.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "0ba76695d6d722b545824ae660296caf4244260ce0e74e98c38b8c329b22b9d0"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Nachdem ihr magnetischer Freund den Durchgang geöffnet hatte, steuerte Mika das Raumschiff in die Dunkelheit des Alls.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "sha256": "aef4c19acdf9c88fc1e22e461062b68ef44cf354df291abf44da3737599a50d8"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Da lang!",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 1120,
      "sha256": "df25cfcf9dde16e85083848f2df8a5d12d7c37128a38939916983f84c48ebb0c"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mikas Raumschiff schoss in den Raumtunnel.",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 2800,
      "sha256": "b08fa746e913847e87b8deed2b1136b7c6dc1c53506bf1a78b5b7994b157d466"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F03",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Hinter dem Tunnel erwartete sie ein riesiger rosafarbener Planet.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "sha256": "8fadc7a323d06278055657a47f51478fcb09465312998de4783bfe64a8b4ca18"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F04",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Die Welt der Neuronenwesen war anders als alles, was sie bisher gesehen hatten.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "0ddc59523dacaa8ef46bed72ebc95b66c5ec68e552c363ea4465127b346cb40a"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Nach vielen Jahren trafen sich alte Freunde wieder. Mika verstand nicht, was sie sagten, doch ihre Freude über das Wiedersehen war deutlich.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 8720,
      "sha256": "e3e425a77b4736937fd4939f592090a2d2cf9c41c939ab7972ffe36e10205971"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P01_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P01_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH06_P01_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika nutzte ihren Simulator, um in eine telepathische Trance einzutauchen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "b4d9c4fa993ebf4ef4a8be330efb04fd2eb2c05e69bb5acaefc3d5556e62835e"
    }
  ],
